"ftdfhm6hjy1hvcndlyui9bpc", "dynamic-registry-consolidation", "should", "User wants consolidation handler to use a dynamic registry pattern instead of explicitly adding each new node type", "User wants consolidation handler to use a dynamic registry pattern instead of explicitly adding each new node type. Currently 7 node types (hidden, concern, config, comparison, temporal, UI, constraint) are each hard-wired in handlers.go. Should refactor to: registry of consolidation steps that return typed results, handler iterates the registry. This avoids editing handlers.go and models.go every time a new node type is added."
"r1fkni8hy0ocwap09ixb5f5z", "end-with-docs-accessed", "must", "MANDATORY: Every phase development doc MUST end with a Documents Accessed list — every file read or referenced during", "MANDATORY: Every phase development doc MUST end with a Documents Accessed list — every file read or referenced during development. This list is the definitive source for which docs need updating before commit. Without it, docs like README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, CHANGELOG.md, API_REFERENCE.md get missed. The user calls these all relevant documentation."
